WEBVTT

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:12.450
Training or not, isn't running 10km every morning a bit much?

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:14.790
What are you, a baby?

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:16.740
Don't worry, we know!

00:00:16.740 --> 00:00:22.870
We have to reach the next stage as Precures to save Trump Kingdom!

00:00:22.870 --> 00:00:25.390
And this training will help us reach it!

00:00:25.390 --> 00:00:28.770
As this is the tenth day, this should be the final session!

00:00:33.020 --> 00:00:35.110
That girl's there again...

00:00:35.980 --> 00:00:37.180
Morimoto?

00:00:44.720 --> 00:00:46.530
Finally! Goal!

00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:48.370
You okay, Rikka?

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:50.000
Do I <i>look</i> okay?

00:00:49.990 --> 00:00:51.570
Man, I'm hungry!

00:00:51.880 --> 00:00:55.400
Then shall we eat breakfast at my estate?

00:00:55.390 --> 00:00:56.300
Can we really?

00:00:56.300 --> 00:00:57.410
Absolutely not!

00:00:57.400 --> 00:01:00.050
You have no time to waste!

00:01:00.050 --> 00:01:03.310
Your final day's schedule is packed until sundown!

00:01:03.910 --> 00:01:07.080
But I wanted to go to the festival with everyone!

00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:08.770
Training comes first!

00:01:08.770 --> 00:01:10.280
Come on... {Fuck you herkz}{sorry for not being deaf :(}{Your apology for being born is accepted.}{check your hearing privilege}

00:01:10.680 --> 00:01:13.410
I agree with the need to train...

00:01:13.410 --> 00:01:15.920
But is this not a bit excessive?

00:01:15.910 --> 00:01:19.140
No, we need to train as hard as humanly...

00:01:24.740 --> 00:01:25.920
Are you okay?

00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:26.920
Aguri!

00:01:29.370 --> 00:01:30.270
Um...

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:31.010
{OP}

00:01:32.830 --> 00:01:37.200
Happy go lucky girls! Precure! Yeah!

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:39.670
The world is like a merry-go-round

00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:42.540
Love makes it turn, 3, 2, 1

00:01:42.860 --> 00:01:44.580
Every day it sparkles

00:01:44.740 --> 00:01:48.270
Dokidoki Precure

00:01:49.750 --> 00:01:55.170
I wear my new clothes and walk a path I've never walked before

00:01:55.760 --> 00:02:00.830
My heart races and I greet the scenery around me

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:06.480
The color of the flower on the corner will be my lucky color for the day

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:11.910
Leave it all to me, because today I'm blessed

00:02:12.770 --> 00:02:17.620
If your friends are in trouble

00:02:17.820 --> 00:02:26.490
isn't it normal to help them?

00:02:26.490 --> 00:02:28.150
Happy lucky Precure

00:02:28.150 --> 00:02:30.580
Only Precure makes my heart pound

00:02:30.800 --> 00:02:33.400
Our happy love will change the world

00:02:33.660 --> 00:02:36.200
What's more than just cute

00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:40.070
is our promise between girls

00:02:40.870 --> 00:02:46.100
I will fight for you and believe in you

00:02:46.140 --> 00:02:52.010
Gather your unparalleled tenderness, yeah, Precure

00:02:59.430 --> 00:03:04.030
Heart Pounding!

00:02:59.430 --> 00:03:04.030
Heart Pounding!

00:03:15.350 --> 00:03:18.120
She should be all better after a bit of rest.

00:03:18.120 --> 00:03:19.430
Thank goodness...

00:03:19.430 --> 00:03:21.680
Thanks for looking out for her.

00:03:22.260 --> 00:03:24.050
Are you a friend of Aguri's?

00:03:24.700 --> 00:03:26.980
W-We're not really friends!

00:03:26.980 --> 00:03:29.920
We're just in the same class...

00:03:32.370 --> 00:03:33.390
What's your name?

00:03:33.680 --> 00:03:35.300
Morimoto Eru.

00:03:35.300 --> 00:03:36.970
Nice name!

00:03:36.970 --> 00:03:40.890
So, how is Aguri at school?

00:03:40.890 --> 00:03:42.340
C'mon, tell us!

00:03:42.330 --> 00:03:44.170
Oh, sure!

00:03:45.010 --> 00:03:48.760
Aguri always acts really grown-up.

00:03:50.850 --> 00:03:53.620
<i>Playing dodgeball indoors could get someone hurt!</i>

00:03:54.290 --> 00:03:58.210
She'd never let anyone tell her she was wrong, even upperclassmen,

00:03:58.210 --> 00:04:02.100
and everyone admires how she stands up for herself!

00:04:02.100 --> 00:04:04.300
Sounds just like how she is with us.

00:04:04.960 --> 00:04:08.570
I was just noticing how well she seems to get along with you all...

00:04:09.170 --> 00:04:12.930
since she doesn't seem interested in her classmates...

00:04:12.930 --> 00:04:13.910
Huh?

00:04:13.910 --> 00:04:16.970
I mean, it's not like she ignores us!

00:04:17.940 --> 00:04:20.040
She talks to everyone,

00:04:20.040 --> 00:04:22.690
and she does her work in group projects,

00:04:22.690 --> 00:04:27.010
but she never does anything more with us...

00:04:30.270 --> 00:04:33.220
So, Eru, you want to be friends with Aguri?

00:04:33.600 --> 00:04:34.510
Huh?

00:04:34.510 --> 00:04:36.730
Uh, th-that's not really it...

00:04:36.730 --> 00:04:39.870
It totally is, so leave it to us!

00:04:39.870 --> 00:04:41.870
The Happy Prince all over again...

00:04:47.300 --> 00:04:48.740
Aguri!

00:04:48.740 --> 00:04:50.180
You're all right!

00:04:50.180 --> 00:04:51.440
Morimoto...

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:54.970
She was worried about you, so she stayed here the whole time!

00:04:54.970 --> 00:04:58.670
I'm fine, so we need to resume our training!

00:04:58.670 --> 00:05:00.810
Now now, know your limits.

00:05:01.210 --> 00:05:05.220
Straining yourself when you're sick is bad for the body.

00:05:05.530 --> 00:05:07.620
Taking breaks is important as well.

00:05:08.150 --> 00:05:09.640
And that means...

00:05:09.640 --> 00:05:12.880
that today's training is officially over!

00:05:12.880 --> 00:05:16.830
So how about we go to the summer festival with Eru?

00:05:17.370 --> 00:05:18.660
Summer festival?

00:05:18.660 --> 00:05:21.720
Yeah! There'll be fireworks!

00:05:21.720 --> 00:05:24.670
Not to mention the Super Special Scrumptious Sweets!

00:05:24.660 --> 00:05:28.210
Super Special Scrumptious Sweets?

00:05:30.860 --> 00:05:33.880
Why would I go to a festival for <i>that</i>?

00:05:34.260 --> 00:05:35.640
What say you, Eru?

00:05:36.660 --> 00:05:40.560
W-Well, if Aguri's okay with it, I'd like to go...

00:05:40.560 --> 00:05:41.850
Sounds like a plan!

00:05:41.850 --> 00:05:43.060
But...

00:05:43.060 --> 00:05:46.370
It's important to spend time with your friends.

00:05:49.230 --> 00:05:50.910
I understand.

00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:53.090
Great!

00:05:53.090 --> 00:05:56.410
We'll meet at 7 by the stairs leading to the festival plaza.

00:05:56.410 --> 00:05:57.510
Okay!

00:05:57.510 --> 00:05:59.700
I'll see you at 7, Aguri!

00:05:59.700 --> 00:06:00.740
Take care!

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:04.290
Why did you do that?

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:09.450
I'm not opposed to spending time with friends, either.

00:06:09.450 --> 00:06:13.190
But right now, there's something far more important at stake!

00:06:13.740 --> 00:06:18.920
Is that the reason why you haven't been making friends at school?

00:06:18.920 --> 00:06:20.600
Exactly.

00:06:20.600 --> 00:06:22.630
I used to be the same way.

00:06:23.030 --> 00:06:27.460
Of course, I still haven't forgotten Trump Kingdom.

00:06:27.460 --> 00:06:31.840
But I've learned so much from spending time with everyone.

00:06:33.970 --> 00:06:35.020
Aguri...

00:06:35.950 --> 00:06:38.110
it's good to have friends.

00:06:40.320 --> 00:06:41.840
I understand...

00:06:47.090 --> 00:06:49.060
Blasted Cure Ace...

00:06:49.060 --> 00:06:53.240
Despite my irrefutable beauty, she dared upstage me?

00:06:53.240 --> 00:06:54.590
Makes your stomach turn.

00:06:54.590 --> 00:06:59.220
All I care about now is seeing her put six feet under!

00:06:59.220 --> 00:07:00.780
Dish best served cold.

00:07:02.330 --> 00:07:04.570
What have you been eating?

00:07:05.130 --> 00:07:06.840
Streeeetchy ice cream.

00:07:06.840 --> 00:07:08.790
Streeeetchy, you say?

00:07:10.550 --> 00:07:12.710
Why, that's it!

00:07:14.090 --> 00:07:15.280
You can't have any.

00:07:17.440 --> 00:07:20.950
She can only stay as Cure Ace for five minutes.

00:07:21.360 --> 00:07:26.430
So if I can undo her transformation by streeeetching out the battle, I'll win!

00:07:34.470 --> 00:07:37.330
Make sure you pretend to be dolls.

00:07:37.330 --> 00:07:39.310
You got it!

00:07:40.260 --> 00:07:42.110
Will this really work?

00:07:42.110 --> 00:07:42.810
Oh!

00:07:43.330 --> 00:07:44.600
Eru!

00:07:45.690 --> 00:07:46.920
Thanks for waiting!

00:07:48.720 --> 00:07:50.040
Um...

00:07:50.040 --> 00:07:51.120
Where's Aguri?

00:07:51.110 --> 00:07:51.910
Huh?

00:08:01.380 --> 00:08:03.730
<i>There are so many yummy-looking sweets{ around me}!</i>

00:08:04.180 --> 00:08:06.550
<i>I want to eat them all!</i>

00:08:07.510 --> 00:08:09.440
Found ya, Aguri!

00:08:09.740 --> 00:08:10.970
You're not easy to find!

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:13.610
You were late, girls.

00:08:13.610 --> 00:08:17.750
Come on, didn't we agree to meet by the stairs?

00:08:17.750 --> 00:08:18.390
Huh?

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:19.660
Oh, don't worry.

00:08:19.660 --> 00:08:22.580
Anyway, that yukata looks great on you!

00:08:22.920 --> 00:08:26.090
This is something my grandmother gave me...

00:08:26.340 --> 00:08:28.350
It's so cute, Aguri!

00:08:28.800 --> 00:08:30.990
Thank you, Morimoto.

00:08:32.480 --> 00:08:33.630
Um...

00:08:35.430 --> 00:08:37.830
Eru's looks cute too, right?

00:08:39.880 --> 00:08:43.040
Yes, it's very cute, Eru... {Precure has taught me that little girls greet each other by calling everything around them kawaii.}

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:50.850
Now, how about those Super Special Scrumptious Sweets?

00:08:50.850 --> 00:08:52.370
In time.

00:08:52.370 --> 00:08:54.520
First, we enjoy the festival!

00:08:54.520 --> 00:08:55.710
Um...

00:08:56.150 --> 00:08:57.620
Wanna do the Goldfish Scoop?

00:08:57.990 --> 00:08:59.820
Goldfish Scoop?

00:09:01.920 --> 00:09:02.850
I did it! {Black goldfish are apparently a thing? Okay.}

00:09:04.630 --> 00:09:05.800
The net broke...

00:09:06.120 --> 00:09:07.270
Too bad!

00:09:07.670 --> 00:09:11.470
I see. It's called "Goldfish Scoop" because you scoop goldfish.

00:09:12.180 --> 00:09:15.140
But I wanted this black moor... {Yeah, black goldfishes are in fact a thing.}

00:09:15.430 --> 00:09:16.670
Don't worry.

00:09:16.670 --> 00:09:19.940
I'll show you the reason they call me the "Goldfish Super Scooper"!

00:09:19.940 --> 00:09:21.710
My stall ain't that easy.

00:09:21.700 --> 00:09:22.780
Here I go!

00:09:24.930 --> 00:09:26.150
Didn't seem too super to me.

00:09:27.070 --> 00:09:28.350
Then allow me!

00:09:29.350 --> 00:09:31.750
Think you can, little lady?

00:09:37.460 --> 00:09:39.360
Wow!

00:09:44.800 --> 00:09:46.230
Watch it!

00:09:46.230 --> 00:09:48.560
Keep your dolls outta the water.

00:09:48.560 --> 00:09:52.200
But I tell ya, toys these days are really somethin'...

00:09:53.740 --> 00:09:55.360
I shall try next!

00:09:55.360 --> 00:09:56.140
You can do it!

00:09:56.490 --> 00:10:01.050
Listen, try to scoop on the water's surface at a 45 degree angle.

00:10:01.620 --> 00:10:02.690
I understand.

00:10:03.690 --> 00:10:04.280
It's time!

00:10:09.090 --> 00:10:10.970
Aguri, you're soaked...

00:10:10.970 --> 00:10:13.240
As are you, Eru...

00:10:33.510 --> 00:10:34.520
I hit it!

00:10:35.170 --> 00:10:36.620
Too bad!

00:10:36.620 --> 00:10:39.730
Ya gotta make it fall off the shelf!

00:10:40.940 --> 00:10:42.230
Allow me...

00:10:44.400 --> 00:10:46.990
Makopi's aiming at the Makopi card!

00:10:49.440 --> 00:10:51.230
Hey, congrats!

00:10:51.890 --> 00:10:54.000
It takes more than just aim.

00:10:54.610 --> 00:10:56.700
You have to predict the bullet's trajectory.

00:11:03.230 --> 00:11:04.900
Just shoot already!

00:11:06.930 --> 00:11:09.090
Congrats!

00:11:09.680 --> 00:11:12.820
I shall avenge Eru's honor!

00:11:12.820 --> 00:11:13.790
You can do it!

00:11:15.900 --> 00:11:16.660
It's time!

00:11:17.420 --> 00:11:18.620
<i>Ace Shot!</i>

00:11:19.120 --> 00:11:20.690
<i>Bang!</i>

00:11:22.240 --> 00:11:24.350
Wow, Aguri!

00:11:27.680 --> 00:11:29.950
Yummy!

00:11:29.950 --> 00:11:32.920
But this is just regular shaved ice.

00:11:32.920 --> 00:11:36.310
What about the Super Special Scrumptious Sweets?

00:11:39.810 --> 00:11:40.850
Want a bite?

00:11:40.850 --> 00:11:41.800
N-No...

00:11:43.330 --> 00:11:43.820
Here.

00:11:48.140 --> 00:11:49.660
Yummy!

00:11:49.980 --> 00:11:53.710
The bitterness of the green tea envelops the sweet azuki beans!

00:11:53.710 --> 00:11:55.300
Bravo!

00:11:56.390 --> 00:11:58.510
Please, have a sample of mine!

00:11:58.510 --> 00:11:59.420
Sure!

00:11:59.420 --> 00:12:02.280
All right, we're all having a shaved ice swap!

00:12:02.270 --> 00:12:04.140
A brilliant idea!

00:12:04.440 --> 00:12:07.210
Her true colors shine when sweets are involved...

00:12:24.320 --> 00:12:25.880
It's strange.

00:12:25.880 --> 00:12:31.170
The ice you all shared with me tasted better than mine.

00:12:31.430 --> 00:12:32.710
No surprise.

00:12:32.710 --> 00:12:34.820
It's because you were eating with everyone!

00:12:34.820 --> 00:12:35.740
With everyone?

00:12:36.030 --> 00:12:36.660
Yeah.

00:12:37.240 --> 00:12:39.710
A friend of mine said the same thing.

00:12:43.460 --> 00:12:47.550
Wait, could the Super Special Scrumptious Sweets have been... {fucking gipped.}

00:12:53.320 --> 00:12:54.490
Geez.

00:12:54.490 --> 00:12:58.060
If all these people weren't here, I could have the show all to myself.

00:13:01.200 --> 00:13:03.160
But I guess it's more fun with more people around...

00:13:05.270 --> 00:13:06.950
Aw, just...

00:13:06.950 --> 00:13:08.660
have it for yourself.

00:13:09.550 --> 00:13:10.980
We shall grant...

00:13:10.980 --> 00:13:12.610
your desire two-fold!

00:13:21.250 --> 00:13:22.550
Go berserk!

00:13:22.550 --> 00:13:25.500
Release the darkness in your heart!

00:13:32.250 --> 00:13:33.820
It's the summer festival!

00:13:33.820 --> 00:13:35.540
Everyone, go home!

00:13:37.730 --> 00:13:39.500
Did you finish your homework?

00:13:40.430 --> 00:13:41.740
It's a Selfish!

00:13:45.180 --> 00:13:46.980
Eru, let's escape!

00:13:48.140 --> 00:13:49.250
Girls, let's go!

00:13:49.530 --> 00:13:50.310
Right!

00:13:51.240 --> 00:13:53.080
Charles!

00:13:54.270 --> 00:13:57.020
Precure Love Link!

00:13:57.260 --> 00:13:58.010
L-O-V-E!

00:13:58.010 --> 00:13:58.770
L-O-V-E!

00:13:58.770 --> 00:13:59.450
L-O-V-E!

00:13:59.450 --> 00:14:00.520
L-O-V-E!

00:14:17.330 --> 00:14:18.670
Brimming with love,

00:14:19.330 --> 00:14:20.770
Cure Heart!

00:14:23.830 --> 00:14:25.150
The light of wisdom,

00:14:25.990 --> 00:14:27.460
Cure Diamond!

00:14:29.750 --> 00:14:31.600
The warmth of the sun,

00:14:32.510 --> 00:14:33.940
Cure Rosetta!

00:14:35.450 --> 00:14:36.840
The blade of courage,

00:14:37.500 --> 00:14:38.800
Cure Sword!

00:14:42.090 --> 00:14:44.480
Listen to the heartbeat of love!

00:14:44.480 --> 00:14:46.140
Dokidoki Precure!

00:14:48.310 --> 00:14:50.710
Oh poor summer festival who has lost his love,

00:14:51.270 --> 00:14:52.870
I, Cure Heart,

00:14:52.870 --> 00:14:56.320
will make your heart race once more!

00:14:56.600 --> 00:14:59.120
You appear once again, Precures.

00:14:59.110 --> 00:15:01.820
Huh? Our target's gone.

00:15:01.810 --> 00:15:04.420
Hold on! Where is Cure Ace?

00:15:04.860 --> 00:15:06.910
Even without Cure Ace...

00:15:06.910 --> 00:15:08.890
We can fight you on our own!

00:15:08.880 --> 00:15:10.890
Why you insolent...

00:15:11.180 --> 00:15:12.420
Destroy them!

00:15:12.420 --> 00:15:13.920
Yo-yo yo!

00:15:19.430 --> 00:15:21.340
Time to pop off! {alt. "I'm poppin' caps!"}

00:15:27.830 --> 00:15:29.250
<i>The girls...</i>

00:15:29.250 --> 00:15:30.110
There she is!

00:15:30.740 --> 00:15:32.580
Target located!

00:15:32.570 --> 00:15:35.280
You need to <i>cut</i> it out!

00:15:35.540 --> 00:15:36.780
Eru, run!

00:15:49.600 --> 00:15:52.150
Worry not about me, just run!

00:15:52.630 --> 00:15:55.070
Now is your chance to finish her off!

00:15:55.060 --> 00:15:56.400
We won't let you!

00:15:57.610 --> 00:15:59.040
Seeelf!

00:15:59.440 --> 00:16:02.810
Precure Sparkle Sword!

00:16:05.730 --> 00:16:07.870
Let me go, Eru!

00:16:07.870 --> 00:16:08.890
I won't!

00:16:09.240 --> 00:16:12.850
I want to be your friend, Aguri!

00:16:13.180 --> 00:16:14.850
But why go so far?

00:16:15.630 --> 00:16:18.930
You helped me, Aguri!

00:16:20.230 --> 00:16:24.030
When all the boys were making fun of my frizzy hair...

00:16:24.710 --> 00:16:27.980
<i>There's nothing more deplorable than ridiculing someone for their appearance!</i>

00:16:27.980 --> 00:16:29.240
<i>You should all be ashamed!</i>

00:16:29.690 --> 00:16:34.740
<i>It's a waste of time to be distressed over what other people say about you.</i>

00:16:35.170 --> 00:16:39.350
<i>After all, your hair is very cute!</i>

00:16:40.850 --> 00:16:42.940
I was so happy!

00:16:42.940 --> 00:16:44.790
So this time...

00:16:44.790 --> 00:16:46.380
I'm going to save you!

00:16:46.900 --> 00:16:50.590
You held something I said to you so dearly...

00:16:53.450 --> 00:16:56.360
You're overflowing... with love!

00:17:09.360 --> 00:17:10.950
Thank you, Eru.

00:17:12.060 --> 00:17:13.620
Aguri...

00:17:13.930 --> 00:17:15.820
Prepare for a ring out!

00:17:19.760 --> 00:17:23.140
Eru, I have a secret,

00:17:23.140 --> 00:17:25.120
but I can't tell you what it is.

00:17:25.530 --> 00:17:28.330
Will you still trust in me?

00:17:28.320 --> 00:17:29.730
I will!

00:17:29.730 --> 00:17:32.170
I trust you, Aguri!

00:17:32.500 --> 00:17:35.640
Then will you close your eyes and wait patiently?

00:17:35.630 --> 00:17:36.450
Yeah!

00:17:40.280 --> 00:17:41.380
Ai!

00:17:42.870 --> 00:17:45.680
Precure Dress Up!

00:17:46.040 --> 00:17:48.100
Kyupirappa!

00:18:33.940 --> 00:18:35.680
Love's trump card,

00:18:35.680 --> 00:18:36.990
Cure Ace!

00:18:39.810 --> 00:18:42.350
Beauty is the mark of the righteous!

00:18:43.620 --> 00:18:45.170
With a single wink,

00:18:45.170 --> 00:18:48.240
I shall pierce your heart!

00:18:49.230 --> 00:18:50.350
Cure Ace!

00:18:50.670 --> 00:18:51.980
She's arrived!

00:18:51.980 --> 00:18:54.920
This attack will streeeetch it out for five minutes!

00:18:56.080 --> 00:18:57.520
Yo-yo yo!

00:18:58.720 --> 00:19:00.150
Poppin' caps!

00:19:03.650 --> 00:19:04.630
Ring around the rosie!

00:19:09.320 --> 00:19:10.800
Cure Ace!

00:19:11.070 --> 00:19:12.910
One minute down.

00:19:12.910 --> 00:19:15.510
Four more until your transformation wears off!

00:19:15.510 --> 00:19:17.640
Then we'll wipe out the Precures,

00:19:17.630 --> 00:19:21.430
and suck out all the Psyche from humankind we can get!

00:19:23.720 --> 00:19:26.810
Eru is waiting for me out of trust.

00:19:27.760 --> 00:19:29.090
And for her...

00:19:30.590 --> 00:19:32.750
I shall fight! {Literally nakama power. Fuck this terrible show.}

00:19:35.690 --> 00:19:36.590
What?!

00:19:37.340 --> 00:19:39.440
Though I fight for more than just her.

00:19:39.440 --> 00:19:42.300
For daring to harm my dear friends,

00:19:42.690 --> 00:19:44.270
you shall not escape unscathed!

00:19:52.290 --> 00:19:55.720
I understand why you invited me to this festival.

00:19:56.990 --> 00:20:00.710
Until now, I thought only of myself.

00:20:01.310 --> 00:20:07.990
But you made me realize that there were people who cared about me right by my side.

00:20:08.580 --> 00:20:13.560
And that realization gave me the power of love!

00:20:13.920 --> 00:20:15.180
That's right.

00:20:15.180 --> 00:20:19.640
But you were the one who taught us that to begin with!

00:20:21.360 --> 00:20:25.600
I meant to teach you, but you girls ended up teaching me.

00:20:26.860 --> 00:20:28.070
Seeelf!

00:20:28.590 --> 00:20:30.610
Leave this to me.

00:20:43.680 --> 00:20:44.920
Beautify!

00:20:44.920 --> 00:20:47.670
Love Kiss Rouge!

00:20:55.050 --> 00:20:56.360
Your heart shall go aflutter!

00:20:56.360 --> 00:20:57.830
Ace Shot!

00:20:57.830 --> 00:20:59.470
Bang!

00:21:07.640 --> 00:21:10.230
Love love loooove!

00:21:19.730 --> 00:21:22.630
Hey, we didn't even hit three minutes!

00:21:22.630 --> 00:21:23.990
Shut up, you!

00:21:23.990 --> 00:21:26.410
Our streeeetch out attack failed!

00:21:31.340 --> 00:21:32.400
Eru.

00:21:35.000 --> 00:21:36.980
It's okay now.

00:21:37.370 --> 00:21:39.050
Aguri...

00:21:40.510 --> 00:21:42.480
I'm so glad you're safe...

00:21:45.500 --> 00:21:47.620
<i>My heart is pounding...</i>

00:22:04.780 --> 00:22:04.820
{ED}

00:22:07.440 --> 00:22:09.960
Professor Davi, we beg of you!

00:22:09.960 --> 00:22:11.140
Wh-What is it?

00:22:11.140 --> 00:22:13.310
I want to help Mana!

00:22:13.310 --> 00:22:15.510
I want to study with Rikka!

00:22:15.510 --> 00:22:18.980
I want to sing lullabies for Alice!

00:22:18.980 --> 00:22:23.080
So we want you to teach us to transform into humans!

00:22:23.080 --> 00:22:26.250
I see. Leave it to me!

00:22:27.390 --> 00:22:28.720
<i>Dokidoki Precure</i>:

00:22:28.720 --> 00:22:31.790
It's All For Mana! 

00:22:28.720 --> 00:22:31.790
It's All For Mana! 

00:22:31.790 --> 00:22:33.920
That knot in your heart won't come undone!
